        <mxCell id="scope" value="&lt;b&gt;C4 scope.&lt;/b&gt; Only encoder self-attention Q/K/V/O is shared. Encoder src_attn, cross_attn, FFNs, normalisation, decoder, context branch and output head remain independent.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Solid arrows = data flow. Dashed teal arrows = shared parameters only. C4 reduces parameters, not FLOPs, because all three encoder attention operations still execute." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="635" width="1120" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
